<h1>PART 3 &mdash; Quick Reference</h1>

<h2>3.1 Attendance Cell Value Reference Table</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Cell Value</th><th>Label Below Cell</th><th>Status Name</th><th>Leave Balance</th><th>Payable Day?</th><th>Who Can Set</th></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-green'>1</span></td><td><em>none</em></td><td><strong>Present</strong></td><td>No change</td><td><span class='ok'>Yes (+1.0)</span></td><td>POC &amp; Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-red'>0</span></td><td><em>none</em></td><td><strong>Absent</strong></td><td>No change</td><td><span class='no'>No</span></td><td>POC &amp; Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-blue'>1</span></td><td>Paid</td><td><strong>Paid Leave</strong></td><td>&minus;1.0 day</td><td><span class='ok'>Yes (+1.0)</span></td><td>POC &amp; Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-gray'>0</span></td><td>Unpaid</td><td><strong>Unpaid Leave</strong></td><td>No change</td><td><span class='no'>No</span></td><td>POC &amp; Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-yellow'>1</span></td><td>Carried</td><td><strong>Half-Day #1 (Carried)</strong></td><td>No change (pending)</td><td><span class='ok'>Yes (+1.0 temp)</span></td><td>POC &amp; Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-blue'>1</span></td><td>Paired Paid</td><td><strong>Half-Day #2 &mdash; Paired Paid</strong></td><td>&minus;1.0 day (for pair)</td><td><span class='ok'>Yes (+1.0)</span></td><td>System (auto-set)</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-red'>0</span></td><td>Paired Unpaid</td><td><strong>Half-Day #2 &mdash; Paired Unpaid</strong></td><td>No change</td><td><span class='no'>No</span></td><td>System (auto-set)</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-purple'>0</span></td><td>Auto Sat-Cut</td><td><strong>Auto Saturday Cut</strong></td><td>No change</td><td><span class='no'>No</span></td><td>System (auto-set)</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;'><span class='cell-demo cell-orange'>1</span></td><td>Holiday</td><td><strong>Public Holiday</strong></td><td>No change</td><td><span class='ok'>Yes (+1.0)</span></td><td>Admin only</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='text-align:center;color:#94a3b8;'><em>empty</em></td><td>&mdash;</td><td><strong>Not Marked</strong></td><td>No change</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3.2 Saturday Cut Reference Chart</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Mon</th><th>Tue</th><th>Wed</th><th>Thu</th><th>Fri</th><th>Saturday Result</th></tr>
  <tr><td>P / PL / HD</td><td>P / PL / HD</td><td>P / PL / HD</td><td>P / PL / HD</td><td>P / PL / HD</td><td><span class='ok'>Present (1)</span> &mdash; Employee attended all 5 days</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='color:#dc2626;'><strong>Absent</strong></td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td><span class='no'>Auto Sat-Cut (0)</span> &mdash; Any one day absent &rarr; Saturday cut</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>P</td><td style='color:#dc2626;'><strong>Absent</strong></td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td><span class='no'>Auto Sat-Cut (0)</span> &mdash; Any one day absent &rarr; Saturday cut</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td style='color:#dc2626;'><strong>Absent</strong></td><td><span class='no'>Auto Sat-Cut (0)</span> &mdash; Any one day absent &rarr; Saturday cut</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>P</td><td>HD (Carried)</td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td><span class='ok'>Present (1)</span> &mdash; Half-day counts as &ldquo;came&rdquo;</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P</td><td>P</td><td>P</td><td>PL (Paid Leave)</td><td>P</td><td><span class='ok'>Present (1)</span> &mdash; Paid Leave counts as &ldquo;came&rdquo;</td></tr>
  <tr colspan='6'><td colspan='6'><em>Rule: If the employee genuinely &ldquo;came&rdquo; (value = 1, or 0.5, or any leave type of Paid/Carried/Paired Paid/Paired Unpaid, or is a Holiday) on all 5 weekdays &rarr; Saturday = Present. Even one genuine &ldquo;Absent&rdquo; (value = 0 with no paid leave) &rarr; Saturday = Auto Sat-Cut.</em></td></tr>
</table>

